WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.668
It checks the controller's Oh My Pi,

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.516
then starts it against the daemon.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.223
The controller opens on its start procedure,

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.885
and the daemon records it as the project's controller.
